<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91171" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτερύσσομαι</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτερύ̆γ-ττομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ξομαι</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flutter, flap the wings</i>
			like a cock crowing, <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				65.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>VH</u>
				2.41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				7.7
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπτερύσσετο</span> shd.
			perh. be restd. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπτ-</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				49
			</span></i> Diehl. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			metaph., <i>triumph, exult</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diph.
				61.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>become full-fledged, spread one's wings for flight</i>, of the
			soul, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.32
			</span></i>, al.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
